## Agent Setup (MCP)

Add to GitHub > Settings > Copilot > MCP configuration:

```json
{
  "mcpServers": {
    "playwright-test": {
      "type": "stdio",
      "command": "npx",
      "args": ["playwright", "run-test-mcp-server"],
      "tools": ["*"]
    }
  }
}
```

| Issue | Solution |
|-------|----------|
| Agents not showing | Add MCP config, reload VS Code |
| MCP server not starting | `npx playwright install` |
| Tests fail | Check selectors in `src/selectors/index.ts` |

---

## Pipeline Flow

```mermaid
graph LR
    User[User Request] --> Req[Requirements Agent]
    Req --> Queue[agent-queue.json]
    Queue --> Planner[Planner Agent]
    Planner --> Generator[Generator Agent]
    Generator --> Tests[.spec.ts]
    Tests --> Pass{Pass?}
    Pass -->|No| Healer[Healer Agent]
    Healer --> Tests
    Pass -->|Yes| Audit[Audit Agent]
```

| Agent | Reads | Creates | Updates |
|-------|-------|---------|---------|
| Requirements | REQUIREMENTS.md | queue entry | REQUIREMENTS.md |
| Planner | queue, website | test-cases/, test-plans/, selectors | queue |
| Generator | test-plans/, examples/ | .spec.ts, page objects | test-cases/ |
| Healer | .spec.ts, errors | - | .spec.ts, selectors |
| Audit | all files | audit report | agent-mistakes.md |

